She's already dead.

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:13,880
It's fake.

4
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:14,960
It's all fake!

5
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,560
It's all fake. All fake.

6
00:00:17,720 --> 00:00:19,400
There's no ghost.
There's no ghost at all.

7
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:20,480
She's already dead, you hear me?

8
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:21,720
I'm telling you, she's already dead.

9
00:00:21,720 --> 00:00:22,720
She's already dead.

10
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:25,000
You hear me?

11
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:26,480
I'm going to the police.

12
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,440
I'm going to the police.

13
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,040
I'm going to the police.

14
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:28,960
I'm going to the police.

15
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,140
(Based on the novel
Doctor Qin: Executer)

16
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:49,860
=Doctor Qin: Executer=
=Episode 6=

17
00:01:52,840 --> 00:01:53,640
Mr. Han!

18
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:55,160
I'm Le Tianyi.

19
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:55,720
Listen,

20
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:57,600
I'm almost at the police station.

21
00:01:57,880 --> 00:01:59,800
I have to tell you everything I know...

22
00:01:59,800 --> 00:02:00,560
I...

23
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:01,880
Ou Wen, trace the location!

24
00:02:01,880 --> 00:02:02,560
Got it!

25
00:02:06,420 --> 00:02:07,860
(Search Area: Longfan City)

26
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:12,360
I've located his phone.

27
00:02:12,480 --> 00:02:13,960
Margin of error under fifty meters.

28
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:14,920
Give me the location!

29
00:02:15,600 --> 00:02:16,560
The signal source...

30
00:02:17,360 --> 00:02:18,520
is right at our front door!

31
00:02:21,260 --> 00:02:23,420
(Vehicle Registration)

32
00:02:25,380 --> 00:02:28,420
(Motor Vehicle Registration, Le Tianyi)

33
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,760
Preliminary inspection showed

34
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:37,560
no signs of a struggle and no blood.

35
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:38,720
No signs of violence.

36
00:02:38,760 --> 00:02:40,080
He probably got out willingly.

37
00:02:41,280 --> 00:02:42,280
In the blink of an eye,

38
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,200
he was gone.

39
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,480
Han Liang.

40
00:02:46,160 --> 00:02:46,960
What's the situation?

41
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:55,920
This isn't just an ordinary water stain.

42
00:02:56,120 --> 00:02:57,200
At 6:28,

43
00:02:57,200 --> 00:02:59,080
Le Tianyi's car passed
the convenience store.

44
00:02:59,080 --> 00:03:01,320
That's three minutes
before he called you.

45
00:03:01,720 --> 00:03:02,640
At 6:30,

46
00:03:02,640 --> 00:03:04,880
a white van passed the store
going in the same direction.

47
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:05,920
At 6:33,

48
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:08,080
the white van passed the store
going the opposite direction.

49
00:03:08,240 --> 00:03:09,600
In those thirty minutes,

50
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:10,560
besides Le Tianyi's car

51
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,760
and the white van,

52
00:03:11,760 --> 00:03:13,960
no other vehicle passed
through that area.

53
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,400
So basically, we can pin down

54
00:03:15,400 --> 00:03:17,200
that Le Tianyi was in that white van.

55
00:03:17,720 --> 00:03:18,640
Any vehicle info?

56
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,240
Yes.

57
00:03:19,240 --> 00:03:20,880
Plate number Fan A 6580.

58
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:21,960
It's a fake plate.

59
00:03:22,040 --> 00:03:23,920
And the plate's
already been deregistered.

60
00:03:23,920 --> 00:03:25,680
Where's the anchor point
for the van's first appearance?

61
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:28,360
The earliest anchor point is

62
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:30,000
at 6:12.

63
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:33,120
Entering Huaxin Road into the city
from Fengshan township road.

64
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,080
And the spot where it disappeared

65
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:35,360
is the same place.

66
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,520
No other area

67
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,800
caught that white van on camera.

68
00:03:39,040 --> 00:03:40,320
Fengshan again?

69
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,560
I've got a bad feeling.

70
00:03:45,040 --> 00:03:45,840
(Mr. Han!)

71
00:03:46,040 --> 00:03:47,160
(I'm Le Tianyi.)

72
00:03:47,160 --> 00:03:47,720
(Listen,)

73
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,360
(I'm almost at the police station.)

74
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:51,520
(I have to tell you
everything I know...)

75
00:03:51,520 --> 00:03:52,160
(I...)

76
00:03:58,920 --> 00:03:59,760
Something's off.

77
00:04:03,840 --> 00:04:04,800
What's off?

78
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,200
If he was on his way to the station,

79
00:04:07,800 --> 00:04:09,720
why would he just park his car here?

80
00:04:16,800 --> 00:04:17,760
The door's unlocked.

81
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:18,760
And the engine's still running.

82
00:04:19,560 --> 00:04:20,360
Unless...

83
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:35,760
From the way he sounded on the phone,

84
00:04:35,960 --> 00:04:37,160
it's like he was being coerced.

85
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,480
Maybe he knew some secret,

86
00:04:39,480 --> 00:04:40,440
or maybe he was involved

87
00:04:40,440 --> 00:04:41,520
in something shady.

88
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,160
His turning himself in today

89
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:44,280
was purely spontaneous.

90
00:04:44,600 --> 00:04:46,360
He got kidnapped on the way here.

91
00:04:46,920 --> 00:04:48,880
That means someone
was watching him closely.

92
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:50,680
Have you contacted Le Tianyi's family?

93
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:52,120
Le Tianyi's wife, Wang Xuan, is a nurse

94
00:04:52,200 --> 00:04:53,880
in the internal medicine ward
at the Second Municipal Hospital.

95
00:04:54,320 --> 00:04:55,240
We reached her.

96
00:04:55,240 --> 00:04:56,320
But no one picked up.

97
00:04:56,480 --> 00:04:57,920
I confirmed with her workplace.

98
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,280
She did take leave.

99
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,880
It was because her kid was sick.

100
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,480
I got the report.

101
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:05,560
The colorless liquid residue

102
00:05:05,680 --> 00:05:07,320
from the driver's seat

103
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:08,920
is high-purity medical ether.

104
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:10,760
And a tracker.

105
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:12,120
See? What did I tell you?

106
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,760
Someone who could monitor
Le Tianyi's movements

107
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:15,000
in real time.

108
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,360
And had access to controlled substances.

109
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:19,400
And she took leave
the day her husband went missing.

110
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:21,520
We really need to have a good talk
with Wang Xuan.

111
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:28,860
(Public Security)

112
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:30,400
So these things...

113
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:32,360
- What's going on?
- No idea.

114
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,360
Mr. Han.

115
00:06:34,240 --> 00:06:36,280
This is the person
who reported it, Zhou Jianming.

116
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,880
He owns this farm.

117
00:06:38,440 --> 00:06:39,360
S-sir...

118
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,760
I... I was just raising my pigs.

119
00:06:41,760 --> 00:06:43,680
How... how did I end up
in something this big?

120
00:06:44,240 --> 00:06:44,840
Han Liang.

121
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,920
It's a mix of human and animal tissue.

122
00:06:50,280 --> 00:06:52,200
How do human and animal
get mixed together?

123
00:06:54,880 --> 00:06:56,960
A grinder. Ground up first.

124
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:58,200
Then mixed into the feed.

125
00:07:00,960 --> 00:07:03,040
- Calm down!
- Who did this?

126
00:07:03,040 --> 00:07:04,080
We handle cases by the book.

127
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:05,520
Where did this feed come from?

128
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,240
I don't know either!

129
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:08,640
I... I always fed them

130
00:07:08,640 --> 00:07:10,800
proper pig feed.

131
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,200
The bone belongs to a human wrist.

132
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,280
The teeth are human as well.

133
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,520
Mr. Han,

134
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,280
two civilian surveillance cameras
are down.

135
00:07:17,280 --> 00:07:18,640
Look for tire tracks nearby.

136
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:19,360
Expand the search.

137
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:19,760
Yes.

138
00:07:19,760 --> 00:07:20,160
Got it.

139
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,440
Take everything we can.

140
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:23,640
Should we take the pigs too?

141
00:07:23,640 --> 00:07:24,280
Yes.

142
00:07:24,280 --> 00:07:24,760
Okay.

143
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:26,880
How am I supposed to go on?

144
00:07:27,800 --> 00:07:29,440
Sir.

145
00:07:29,720 --> 00:07:30,760
We'll check everything

146
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:32,640
and make sure to bring them
back to you, alright?

147
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:35,320
Think carefully.

148
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,640
Have you made any enemies lately?

149
00:07:37,960 --> 00:07:38,760
Let me think.

150
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:40,640
Let me think.

151
00:07:43,160 --> 00:07:44,120
Could it be Le Tianyi?

152
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,680
I need to go back and run the DNA.

153
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:46,840
I'm leaving.

154
00:07:46,840 --> 00:07:47,240
Let's go.

155
00:07:50,260 --> 00:07:54,140
(Longfan Public Security Bureau)

156
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,640
Besides human and pig tissue,

157
00:07:57,960 --> 00:08:00,080
there's also fiber material
similar to hemp rope.

158
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:02,280
Bound? Together with the pig?

159
00:08:02,760 --> 00:08:03,560
Yes.

160
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:06,080
And most likely the person
was still alive at the time.

161
00:08:07,520 --> 00:08:09,080
What kind of grudge is that?

162
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:10,520
The white van's been found!

163
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:13,120
About three kilometers from the farm.

164
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,840
Wang Xuan is being examined
for injuries.

165
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,800
Injuries?

166
00:08:16,440 --> 00:08:17,400
From what we can see,

167
00:08:17,400 --> 00:08:19,440
Wang Xuan has been beaten
by Le Tianyi for a long time.

168
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,480
Also,

169
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:24,360
the DNA confirms it's Le Tianyi's.

170
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,400
Wang Xuan.

171
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:21,480
(Cooperate for Leniency)
We've seen

172
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:22,720
your medical report.

173
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,440
I am so sorry

174
00:09:25,880 --> 00:09:26,880
for what you've been through.

175
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:29,640
Ms. Wang,

176
00:09:30,080 --> 00:09:31,040
from what we know,

177
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:32,520
you're a nurse
at the Second Municipal Hospital.

178
00:09:34,600 --> 00:09:36,280
Where were you
the day Le Tianyi went missing?

179
00:09:36,320 --> 00:09:38,920
I took my daughter to my mom's place.

180
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:42,880
Niu had a high fever the night before.

181
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:47,200
Le Tianyi was making a scene all night.

182
00:09:48,240 --> 00:09:49,160
I had no choice

183
00:09:49,800 --> 00:09:50,840
but to get away.

184
00:09:53,960 --> 00:09:54,760
What?

185
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:59,000
Are you suspecting I killed him?

186
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,480
I said missing just now.

187
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,120
How are you so sure Le Tianyi is dead?

188
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:13,320
This is your building's
elevator surveillance.

189
00:10:13,680 --> 00:10:15,040
Not long after Le Tianyi left,

190
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:16,160
you went out alone,

191
00:10:16,600 --> 00:10:17,840
without Niu.

192
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,080
After that, Niu was picked up
by someone.

193
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:21,280
That lie

194
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:23,480
wasn't even a good one.

195
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,480
(Interrogation Record)
Your wounds

196
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:30,240
were all caused by Le Tianyi, right?

197
00:10:30,640 --> 00:10:32,520
Day after day, year after year.

198
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:34,440
Until that night he did it again

199
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,240
and even threatened your child,

200
00:10:36,400 --> 00:10:38,120
you couldn't take it anymore.

201
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:39,320
Isn't that right?

202
00:10:48,800 --> 00:10:51,120
Where's Le Tianyi?

203
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:03,920
That's right.

204
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,400
I killed him.

205
00:11:08,960 --> 00:11:09,760
Wang Xuan,

206
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,520
do you know the consequences of murder?

207
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:13,400
Consequences?

208
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:18,240
Every day I'm alive,

209
00:11:19,400 --> 00:11:21,240
I'm living with the consequences.

210
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,480
He poured

211
00:11:24,600 --> 00:11:26,040
hot soup on me.

212
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:28,080
He burned

213
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:31,040
my arms and thighs

214
00:11:31,680 --> 00:11:32,800
with cigarette butts.

215
00:11:35,640 --> 00:11:37,000
Then he told me

216
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,840
he didn't mean it.

217
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:51,040
There, there.

218
00:11:51,640 --> 00:11:53,240
Alright. You're back.

219
00:11:58,400 --> 00:11:59,640
Keep it down.

220
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:02,000
There, there. Stop crying.

221
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,920
Don't let her cry.

222
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,800
She might be hungry.

223
00:12:07,160 --> 00:12:07,960
Hungry?

224
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,800
Come on, come to daddy.

225
00:12:12,640 --> 00:12:13,880
Come to daddy.

226
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:15,040
Be careful.

227
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:17,240
Come on, let daddy take a look.

228
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:17,920
Be careful.

229
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:18,920
What's going on?

230
00:12:19,040 --> 00:12:21,440
You not eating well?

231
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,160
I'm gonna go feed her.

232
00:12:30,480 --> 00:12:31,280
What are you doing?

233
00:12:31,520 --> 00:12:32,320
You're drunk?

234
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:34,600
Did I say you could feed her?

235
00:12:34,800 --> 00:12:36,160
She's hungry.

236
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:38,760
Did I say it?

237
00:12:39,480 --> 00:12:40,600
I'm telling you,

238
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,440
you have to listen to me.

239
00:12:41,440 --> 00:12:43,400
I'm the one who brings home the bacon.

240
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:44,360
You hear me?

241
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,880
You all listen to me.

242
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:48,360
Tell me you understand.

243
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:50,560
I understand.

244
00:12:50,560 --> 00:12:51,560
You understand, right?

245
00:13:02,140 --> 00:13:05,030
♪In the fog of the long night♪

246
00:13:05,460 --> 00:13:08,380
♪Who hid the truth?♪

247
00:13:08,810 --> 00:13:10,350
♪Good and evil blur♪

248
00:13:10,350 --> 00:13:14,400
♪Lies whisper, sinking
into the riverbed of human nature♪

249
00:13:17,120 --> 00:13:19,690
♪Hearts are like nameless alleys♪

250
00:13:21,360 --> 00:13:23,240
I called the police back then.

251
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:27,280
He knelt down in front of the police

252
00:13:28,160 --> 00:13:30,000
and promised he'd never do it again.

253
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:32,480
But that same night,

254
00:13:34,040 --> 00:13:35,080
he stuck needles

255
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:38,000
into my fingernails.

256
00:13:39,280 --> 00:13:42,360
Stuck needles into my fingernails!

257
00:13:46,080 --> 00:13:47,480
Then he told me

258
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:51,840
that's what I get for running my mouth.

259
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:53,760
Classic escalation of domestic abuse.

260
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:57,240
After their power is challenged,

261
00:13:58,040 --> 00:14:00,360
abusers use more secretive,
more brutal methods

262
00:14:00,480 --> 00:14:02,200
to regain control.

263
00:14:02,320 --> 00:14:03,120
More than that.

264
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,360
Someone like Le Tianyi

265
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,200
represses everything outside

266
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:09,560
and sucks up to his superiors
with no bottom line.

267
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:11,440
His repressed aggression

268
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:12,440
has to go somewhere

269
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:13,760
he thinks is safe.

270
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,400
His outlet

271
00:14:17,160 --> 00:14:18,040
was Wang Xuan.

272
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:20,560
What drove me to despair the most...

273
00:14:22,930 --> 00:14:26,190
♪Souls hide far away♪

274
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:33,080
Honey...

275
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:34,600
Honey, are you okay?

276
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,360
Wait.

277
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:42,920
Do you have a choice?

278
00:14:42,920 --> 00:14:43,960
Do you have a choice?

279
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:48,440
I'm telling you.

280
00:14:49,040 --> 00:14:49,960
I'm telling you.

281
00:14:50,200 --> 00:14:51,760
Look at me. Look at me!

282
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:53,400
You don't have a choice.

283
00:14:54,280 --> 00:14:55,400
Neither do I.

284
00:14:56,160 --> 00:14:57,920
(He took me to meet Zhang Xiaodong.)

285
00:14:58,440 --> 00:15:00,040
(In front of Zhang Xiaodong,)

286
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:04,280
(he wasn't his usual
violent, arrogant self.)

287
00:15:05,400 --> 00:15:06,240
(Instead,)

288
00:15:08,200 --> 00:15:10,480
(he was like a groveling lapdog.)

289
00:15:18,760 --> 00:15:19,560
Tianyi.

290
00:15:20,920 --> 00:15:22,760
Do you know
what your most valuable quality

291
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:23,720
is?

292
00:15:24,520 --> 00:15:25,760
Not your ability,

293
00:15:26,520 --> 00:15:27,760
but your loyalty.

294
00:15:31,480 --> 00:15:32,280
Honey!

295
00:15:33,680 --> 00:15:34,760
Did you hear that?

296
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,520
Mr. Zhang is giving me a hint.

297
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:38,920
He's giving us a chance!

298
00:15:50,960 --> 00:15:51,840
Listen,

299
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:54,240
I really don't like
the look in your eyes right now.

300
00:15:54,320 --> 00:15:55,720
It's just a job.

301
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:56,840
Just a job.

302
00:15:57,240 --> 00:15:58,120
Think about Niu.

303
00:15:58,120 --> 00:16:00,400
Doesn't she deserve a good school?

304
00:16:00,400 --> 00:16:02,960
Can this family ever turn things around?

305
00:16:02,960 --> 00:16:03,760
It's all on you.

306
00:16:07,440 --> 00:16:08,440
Zhang Xiaodong

307
00:16:10,440 --> 00:16:12,040
assaulted me.

308
00:16:20,960 --> 00:16:22,760
This isn't
simple domestic abuse logic anymore.

309
00:16:23,240 --> 00:16:25,560
Le Tianyi doesn't dare resist
Zhang Xiaodong.

310
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:27,720
He even craves Zhang Xiaodong's power.

311
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,240
By helping Zhang Xiaodong

312
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,720
violate his own wife,

313
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:33,160
he completed

314
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,760
a twisted psychological transformation.

315
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:37,160
He's no longer the dominated,

316
00:16:37,400 --> 00:16:39,360
but a co-conspirator sharing power

317
00:16:39,920 --> 00:16:40,720
with the dominator.

318
00:16:40,960 --> 00:16:42,920
He gains a false sense of power

319
00:16:43,480 --> 00:16:44,720
by sacrificing

320
00:16:44,880 --> 00:16:47,080
his own wife.

321
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:51,360
Later, we went home,

322
00:16:52,040 --> 00:16:53,040
and he told me

323
00:16:53,320 --> 00:16:55,160
I was the family's hero

324
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,600
and I should feel proud

325
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:00,720
and grateful.

326
00:17:02,520 --> 00:17:04,840
But I just wanted to leave this home.

327
00:17:05,520 --> 00:17:07,320
I called a lawyer.

328
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:09,040
But the lawyer said

329
00:17:09,360 --> 00:17:11,800
Le Tianyi had already secretly moved
the assets.

330
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:14,160
A lawsuit

331
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,360
could take a long time.

332
00:17:17,080 --> 00:17:18,280
But if it took that long,

333
00:17:18,280 --> 00:17:20,960
I had no way to pay for Niu's treatment.

334
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:23,160
I thought about calling the police.

335
00:17:24,040 --> 00:17:26,320
All his family begged me

336
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:27,760
to endure it

337
00:17:27,880 --> 00:17:29,080
for the kid's sake.

338
00:17:30,960 --> 00:17:32,560
Then when he saw me crying,

339
00:17:33,240 --> 00:17:35,240
he started hitting me again.

340
00:17:36,960 --> 00:17:39,760
Actually, by that point,
I was already dead inside.

341
00:17:39,760 --> 00:17:42,000
It didn't matter if he hit me.

342
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:45,520
But I saw my daughter.

343
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:48,960
She was just standing at the door,

344
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:50,760
watching all of it.

345
00:17:53,080 --> 00:17:54,440
I'll kill you.

346
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,040
Smile!

347
00:17:55,880 --> 00:17:56,360
Right!

348
00:17:57,920 --> 00:17:59,840
That's it. Smile. Be happy. Right.

349
00:18:00,120 --> 00:18:00,880
Die!

350
00:18:01,160 --> 00:18:01,920
Later,

351
00:18:03,480 --> 00:18:05,200
I saw my daughter

352
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:08,680
imitating her dad hitting me,

353
00:18:08,680 --> 00:18:11,160
hitting her favorite doll!

354
00:18:12,120 --> 00:18:13,160
In that moment,

355
00:18:13,560 --> 00:18:14,800
I knew

356
00:18:15,120 --> 00:18:16,720
I had to tell my daughter

357
00:18:16,840 --> 00:18:17,880
that her mom

358
00:18:18,320 --> 00:18:19,360
would help her

359
00:18:19,840 --> 00:18:24,720
tear apart all these rotten days!

360
00:18:26,120 --> 00:18:27,040
This family

361
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:30,320
either rots together,

362
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:32,440
or one person

363
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:36,520
has to completely disappear.

364
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:39,600
So you finally couldn't take it anymore?

365
00:18:41,520 --> 00:18:43,040
How could I have been so naive

366
00:18:44,800 --> 00:18:47,200
to believe him?

367
00:18:47,400 --> 00:18:48,360
Warm your hands.

368
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:50,660
♪In the fog of the long night♪

369
00:18:51,230 --> 00:18:54,040
♪Who hid the truth?♪

370
00:18:54,040 --> 00:18:54,840
(Xuan!)

371
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:58,640
(I want to take care of you and Niu.)

372
00:18:59,800 --> 00:19:02,440
(Yes, I have nothing right now.)

373
00:19:02,920 --> 00:19:04,400
(But I'll work hard!)

374
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:05,680
(I swear!)

375
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:06,840
(I'll spend the rest of my life)

376
00:19:07,280 --> 00:19:08,680
(taking care of you both,)

377
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,120
(no matter what it takes!)

378
00:19:12,830 --> 00:19:15,220
♪Falling into endless confusion♪

379
00:19:18,040 --> 00:19:22,700
♪Dark echoes coil
around the net of the world♪

380
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:28,600
Am I dreaming?

381
00:19:30,720 --> 00:19:33,040
Wake up, Le Tianyi.

382
00:19:33,200 --> 00:19:34,960
Wake up!

383
00:19:41,320 --> 00:19:43,040
There's a package
at the station entrance.

384
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:44,480
No information on it.

385
00:19:45,780 --> 00:19:48,700
(The Executer)

386
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:55,240
Wake up.

387
00:19:55,240 --> 00:19:58,320
(The Executer never misses.)

388
00:19:58,840 --> 00:20:00,120
Help!

389
00:20:00,120 --> 00:20:01,000
High in the tower,

390
00:20:01,680 --> 00:20:03,280
the hypocrite builds her nest,

391
00:20:03,440 --> 00:20:05,280
grinding her struggles into steps,

392
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:07,200
and boiling her tears into soup.

393
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:08,560
(This man)

394
00:20:09,280 --> 00:20:11,640
(is like a pig that can never
be fed enough!)

395
00:20:18,830 --> 00:20:22,260
♪The Executer is never late♪

396
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:24,480
Sir,

397
00:20:25,520 --> 00:20:27,160
I want two jin of pig's head meat.

398
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,200
Fat or lean?

399
00:20:28,560 --> 00:20:30,080
The part with the snout.

400
00:20:30,080 --> 00:20:33,000
♪When the gears crush
the crown of hypocrisy♪

401
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:34,120
Yeah. Wrap it up for me.

402
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:35,160
Alright.

403
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:40,000
♪The crocodile will kiss the collector♪

404
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:40,560
Here.

405
00:20:41,040 --> 00:20:42,160
Okay. Thanks.

406
00:20:42,160 --> 00:20:44,300
♪Listen, the hymn of gnawing bone♪

407
00:20:45,860 --> 00:20:52,500
♪In the grinder,
equality and peace are reborn♪

408
00:21:16,400 --> 00:21:21,010
♪The sunflower bows, reciting names♪

409
00:21:22,170 --> 00:21:25,780
(Need anything? Call your son Qin Ming.)
♪Each petal is a solemn phrase♪

410
00:21:27,470 --> 00:21:31,520
♪And moonlight, forever justly♪

411
00:21:32,060 --> 00:21:33,670
♪Lights up crime and punishment♪

412
00:21:37,330 --> 00:21:41,190
♪Lights up crime and punishment♪

413
00:22:07,720 --> 00:22:11,810
♪Sunset washes over the old wall♪

414
00:22:12,460 --> 00:22:16,530
♪Milk tea cools on the stone steps♪

415
00:22:16,810 --> 00:22:20,780
♪Sea wind tugs at your sleeve♪

416
00:22:21,290 --> 00:22:25,120
♪Unspoken words just flee and fade♪

417
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:38,060
♪The marks on the desk
have faded yellow♪

418
00:22:38,060 --> 00:22:40,890
♪I turned around,
and a gunshot rang out♪

419
00:22:41,560 --> 00:22:45,180
♪No one can truly feel another's pain♪

420
00:22:45,180 --> 00:22:49,390
♪The wind is cold,
a fading shadow sways♪

421
00:22:49,390 --> 00:22:54,130
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

422
00:22:54,130 --> 00:22:58,440
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

423
00:22:59,170 --> 00:23:02,930
♪A bullet pierces the spring night♪

424
00:23:02,930 --> 00:23:07,050
♪You sink into the vast crowd♪

425
00:23:15,990 --> 00:23:20,200
♪Years later, when we meet again♪

426
00:23:20,200 --> 00:23:24,530
♪Don't mention this moonlit night♪

427
00:23:24,530 --> 00:23:28,300
♪The waves smooth
two lines of footprints♪

428
00:23:28,300 --> 00:23:31,210
♪Half a cup of sweetness
sinks into the sand♪

429
00:23:31,210 --> 00:23:36,000
♪Tonight, I don't care
about the universe♪

430
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:40,650
♪I only want to see this through
with you♪

431
00:23:40,650 --> 00:23:42,950
♪Wind back to shore,
clouds back to hills♪

432
00:23:42,950 --> 00:23:45,030
♪We stop here in this night♪

433
00:23:45,030 --> 00:23:49,450
♪This is the past, the only,
the last look back♪

434
00:23:49,450 --> 00:23:55,390
♪One gunshot echoes through half a life♪
